  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lab 507.03 Combined Earnings. In the event of a claim pursuant to RSA 281-A:15, III, the employee shall request that the concurrent employer(s) complete a wage schedule and make it available to the carrier handling the claim.\n\nSource. #6806, eff 7-18-98 (formerly Lab 514.02); ss by #8682, INTERIM, eff 7-15-06, EXPIRED: 1-11-07\n\nNew. #9019, eff 11-1-07; ss by #11067, eff 4-1-16",
